      "id": "001",
      "headline": "Local Man Barry Perry Marries Dairy Fairy in Flurry of Cherry Berries",
      "summary": "The wedding was berry sweet, held in a cherry grove near Ferry Larry's ferry.",
      "fullBody": "Barry Perry, 34, of Cherry, New York, eloped with the Dairy Fairy, a mythical figure who delivers free milkshakes to deserving citizens. The ceremony, officiated by Ferry Larry, took place on his ferry while guests ate cherry berries. 'I never believed in love at first dairy,' Perry said, wiping cream from his mustache. The Dairy Fairy declined to comment but left a trail of glitter and lactose-free optimism.",
