      "id": "004",
      "headline": "Chef Bev Lev's Rev Deviled Eggs Win Award for 'Most Heavenly Hell Food'",
      "summary": "The eggs are so good they're sinful; church groups are conflicted.",
      "fullBody": "Bev Lev, a chef from Beverly Hills, has created deviled eggs so delicious that the Vatican issued a statement. 'They are technically a sin against moderation,' admitted Cardinal Rev Trev. Lev's secret ingredient remains a mystery, though rumors suggest it's a blend of holy water and hot sauce. The dish has been banned in three states for being 'too addictive,' but Lev simply smiles and says, 'The devil's in the details.'",
