      "id": "005",
      "headline": "Gym Owner Jim Slim Claims New 'Slim Gym' Makes You Slim While You Swim",
      "summary": "The facility is a swimming pool full of gelatin; results are wobbly but promising.",
      "fullBody": "Jim Slim, former bodybuilder and current mad scientist, has opened the Slim Gym, where patrons exercise in a pool of lime-flavored gelatin. 'Swimming in Jell-O burns 400% more calories because you can't stop laughing,' Slim claimed while doing laps in cherry gelatin. Early members report mixed results: most have lost weight from laughing, two got stuck, and one was eaten by a confused shark that wandered in during a plumbing mishap. Slim is already planning a 'Brim Gym' where you work out in hats.",
