      "id": "010",
      "headline": "Dr. Phil Hill's Pill Mill Shut Down by Bill Gill's Will Hill Legal Firm",
      "summary": "The alliteration alone was enough to secure a conviction.",
      "fullBody": "Dr. Phil Hill, who operated a suspicious pharmacy on Pill Hill, was finally brought to justice by attorney Bill Gill of the Will Hill Legal Firm. 'We built our case on the sheer absurdity of the name,' Gill admitted, sipping coffee from a mug that read 'Litigate, Don't Hesitate.' Hill's defense—that he was 'just a hill doctor who liked pills'—was rejected by Judge Jill Dill, who sentenced him to community service planting daffodils on actual hills. 'I guess I'm a hill doctor again,' Hill sighed, holding a trowel.",
