      "id": "013",
      "headline": "Tech CEO Rex Vex Unveils 'Hex' App That Predicts Your Next Ex",
      "summary": "The algorithm uses your dating history and star signs; results are devastatingly accurate.",
      "fullBody": "Rex Vex, the eccentric founder of VexTech, has launched 'Hex,' an app that predicts who you'll break up with next. 'We use a combination of AI, astrology, and passive-aggressive text analysis,' Vex explained, demonstrating the app on his own phone. It immediately suggested his assistant. The app has already predicted 10,000 breakups with 97% accuracy, though critics argue it causes the breakups by planting suggestions. 'Correlation isn't causation,' Vex said, while his girlfriend quietly packed a bag in the background.",
