      "id": "014",
      "headline": "Dentist Brent Dent Invents Tent for Rent That Prevents Bad Breath Sent",
      "summary": "The portable mouth tent is already sold out; kissers worldwide rejoice.",
      "fullBody": "Dr. Brent Dent, a dentist from Denton, Texas, has created the 'Breath Tent,' a tiny pop-up enclosure that filters and freshens your exhalations. 'Bad breath is a social pandemic,' Dent declared, demonstrating the tent at a speed-dating event. The device, which looks like a miniature camping tent for your mouth, sold out in four minutes. Early users report increased confidence, though several accidentally swallowed the tent poles. Dent is already developing a 'Scent Tent' for armpits and a 'Lent Tent' for Catholics who need to hide their meat breath during Lent.",
