      "id": "021",
      "headline": "Coach Roach Boasts That His Approach to Coaching is Beyond Reproach",
      "summary": "The team still loses every game, but their self-esteem is impeccable.",
      "fullBody": "Coach Reginald Roach, head of the Roach Roaches high school football team, has defended his 0-47 record by claiming his 'approach is beyond reproach.' 'We don't focus on winning,' Roach explained during a press conference in the school cafeteria. 'We focus on being good people who occasionally wear helmets.' The team has become a local legend, with fans attending games ironically. Last week's match ended 84-0, but the Roaches earned a standing ovation for helping an opposing player tie his shoe. 'We're building character,' Roach insisted, while the scoreboard wept.",
