      "id": "034",
      "headline": "Nurse Purse Worse-for-Wear Curses a Diverse Hearse in Reverse; Universe Disperses",
      "summary": "The incident defies physics and grammar; quantum physicists are taking notes.",
      "fullBody": "Nurse Penny Purse, exhausted after a 36-hour shift, allegedly cursed a 'diverse hearse' (a multicultural funeral procession) that was driving in reverse, causing the universe to 'briefly disperse.' 'I was worse-for-wear and just cursed,' Purse explained, as scientists measured a 0.3-second fluctuation in local spacetime. The hearse, which was backing up due to a GPS error, experienced no harm, but three bystanders report 'feeling very spread out' for a moment. The universe has since re-converged, though astronomers note a slight wobble in Jupiter's orbit. Purse has been given two weeks off and a stern talking-to about 'the power of words.'",
