      "id": "039",
      "headline": "Driver Diver River-Liver Gives a Giver a Shiver with a Silver Sliver",
      "summary": "The Uber driver moonlights as a surgeon; passengers are conflicted.",
      "fullBody": "Derek 'River-Liver' Diver, an Uber driver who lives on a river and loves liver, gave a passenger the shivers by performing minor surgery with a silver sliver during a traffic jam. 'I'm also a giver,' Diver explained, showing his medical license from an unaccredited online school. The passenger, who needed a splinter removed, was initially grateful but became concerned when Diver used fishing line for stitches. 'He saved me $500 in ER bills,' the passenger admitted, 'but I think he used bait as antiseptic.' Diver has been suspended from Uber but hired by a local fishing charter as 'Dr. Diver, MD (Mostly Driving).'",
      "category": "health",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/factictionary/news-content/main/images/2026-07-06/039.jpg",
