      "id": "042",
      "headline": "Jester Lester's 'Mester Tester' Fester Bests a Nester in a Wrester's Vester",
      "summary": "The comedy exam was so bad it grew on people; wrestling vests are involved.",
      "fullBody": "Lester Jester, a court joker turned educator, created the 'Mester Tester,' a comedy exam that 'festers' (grows on you) until you laugh. The test recently 'bested' a 'nester' (bird researcher) wearing a 'wrester's vester' (wrestling vest). 'I was wearing the vester and taking the tester when the fester bested my chest,' the nester explained, still giggling. The exam, which involves answering questions with increasingly absurd puns, has a 40% pass rate but a 100% smile rate. Jester has been hired by three universities to reduce exam anxiety. 'If you can't beat the test, let the test beat you with joy,' he preaches.",
      "category": "education",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/factictionary/news-content/main/images/2026-07-06/042.jpg",
      "publishedAt": "1 day ago",
      "readTimeSeconds": 90,
